ç.","en":"Choose the right option.","de":"Wähle die richtige Antwort."}},{"cefr":"B1","q":"If I ___ more time, I would travel.","options":["would have","had","have","will have"],"answer":1,"hint":{"tr":"Doğru seçeneği seç.","en":"Choose the right option.","de":"Wähle die richtige Antwort."}},{"cefr":"B2","q":"By next year, she ___ her degree.","options":["has finished","will have finished","finishes","will finish"],"answer":1,"hint":{"tr":"Doğru seçeneği seç.","en":"Choose the right option.","de":"Wähle die richtige Antwort."}},{"cefr":"B2","q":"I wish I ___ that.","options":["wouldn't say","didn't say","haven't said","hadn't said"],"answer":3,"hint":{"tr":"Doğru seçeneği seç.","en":"Choose the right option.","de":"Wähle die richtige Antwort."}},{"cefr":"B2","q":"Hardly ___ arrived when it started to rain.","options":["had we","did we","we had","we have"],"answer":0,"hint":{"tr":"Doğru seçeneği seç.","en":"Choose the right option.","de":"Wähle die richtige Antwort."}},{"cefr":"B2","q":"He denied ___ the money.","options":["to take","taking","to have take","take"],"answer":1,"hint":{"tr":"Doğru seçeneği seç.","en":"Choose the right option.","de":"Wähle die richtige Antwort."}}],"verbs":[]}